CONTEXT PurposeRole IN ENGLISH
-- A PURPOSE can document a role. A role exists when it maintains a rule or when an interface is meant for it.

RELATION published[Article*Article] [PROP]
RELATION approvedBy[Article*Editor]

RULE publishApproved : published |- approvedBy;approvedBy~
ROLE Contentmanager MAINTAINS publishApproved
PURPOSE ROLE Contentmanager
{+ Somebody must see to it that only approved articles are published. +}

INTERFACE Articles FOR Reader : V[SESSION*Article] BOX [ approved : approvedBy ]
PURPOSE ROLE Reader
{+ Readers need an overview of the articles and who approved them. +}

ENDCONTEXT
